# Outcome records embed the raw upstream payload verbatim — that is a core
# guarantee of the reconciler, and it means a record from a live call contains
# unmasked phone numbers and provider call ids. Never commit one. Fixtures live
# under fixtures/ and use reserved example numbers only.
apps/python/outcome-reconciler/*.json
